# Btop theme: Osaka (dark, deep teal-navy with solarized-style accents)
# Palette: bg #001c2b, fg #e9e2d0, bright fg #fcf6e3, blue #268bd2, cyan #2aa198,
#          green #809900, yellow #b38800, magenta #d03682, red #d8322f, gray #5f6f74

